# A bound on a table of shapes. Every second, third and fifth of the classes has a field of its own kind, so no numbering of shapes lays the holders of each side by side,
# and each of the three tests reads a table.
# f1 = weigh
# RUN: bytes f1:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: constants=3
# RUN(TABLES): bytes f1:Body mechanisms=all testing=RowSaysLess:Callee/f1/ShapesKnown
# TABLES: constants=3
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
